.Dd May 29, 2026
.Dt ZDOTS-CTL 8
.Os zdots
.Sh NAME
.Nm zdots-ctl
.Nd orchestrate and health-check the zdots platform
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Op Ar options
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
starts, stops, resets, installs, and checks the local zdots service stack.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width install
.It Cm up
Start Colima/LGTM, OTel, AI, and embedding services.
.It Cm down
Stop services in reverse order.
.It Cm reset
Run down then up.
.It Cm install
Register service dependencies and start the platform.
.It Cm check
Run deep diagnostics.
.It Cm status Op Fl -json
Show aggregate service status.
.Pp
In JSON output,
.Cm ai_server
and
.Cm ai_http_healthy
mean the configured
.Pa /health
endpoint answered.
.Cm ai_socket_listening
is reported separately because a bound port can still be an unhealthy server.
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width ZDOTS_SKIP_FIREWALL_CHECK
.It Ev ZDOTS_BOOT_TIMEOUT
Health wait timeout.
.It Ev ZDOTS_AI_ENDPOINT , Ev ZDOTS_AI_EMBED_ENDPOINT
Service endpoints.
.It Ev ZDOTS_REDIS_HOST , Ev ZDOTS_REDIS_PORT
Cache endpoint.
.It Ev ZDOTS_CONTEXT
Enables work-machine security posture checks when set to
.Li work .
.It Ev ZDOTS_CAPTURE_ENABLED , Ev ZDOTS_HISTORY_REDACT , Ev ZDOTS_AI_MODE
PHI safety posture inputs.
.It Ev ZDOTS_DB_ENCRYPTION_KEY
Required for PHI database encryption checks on work machines.
.It Ev ZDOTS_SKIP_FIREWALL_CHECK
Suppress Application Firewall warning.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr capabilities 1 ,
.Xr agent-guide 1 ,
.Xr zdots 7
